* Fix number / order of steps in stay aligned by @loucass003 in https://github.com/SlimeVR/SlimeVR-Server/pull/1475
* Remove BVH button on android builds by @ImUrX in https://github.com/SlimeVR/SlimeVR-Server/pull/1478
* Update VRM reader to the new VMC 1.0 spec by @ImUrX in https://github.com/SlimeVR/SlimeVR-Server/pull/1481
* New Pontoon translations by @SlimeVR-bot in https://github.com/SlimeVR/SlimeVR-Server/pull/1437

