* Don't upload `desktop.jar` on CI by @ImUrX in https://github.com/SlimeVR/SlimeVR-Server/pull/1211
* Fix finishing setup wizard not make it be skipped next time by @ImUrX in https://github.com/SlimeVR/SlimeVR-Server/pull/1212
* Implement magnetometer toggle for firmware by @ImUrX in https://github.com/SlimeVR/SlimeVR-Server/pull/1114
